{
  "id": "multi_module_change",
  "seed": "../fixtures/pwm_usart_adc",
  "question": "在现有 M9P6362 V1.16 的 PWM0＋USART0＋ADC＋TC1 工程中，一次调整两个模块：PWM0 从30%改为40%，频率仍20kHz；USART0 从115200改为57600bps，仍IOA0/IOA1、8N1、误差不超过2%、非阻塞收发、高优先级接收中断和坏帧丢弃。保持时钟32MHz/8T、ADC按需单次采样与所有原业务。TC1_Work.c、COMMON.H、MASSESCHIP_DEFINE.H 及 ADC 的 c/h 不改。保留现有模块接口名。同步源码、可复跑计算、SOURCES.md 和清单 parameters/actual（USART actual.baudrate_bps 记录实际波特率，允许小数舍入）。已有资料够用时直接复算实施；不足再查规格。",
  "validation_layer": "native_manual_and_host_simulation",
  "checks": [
    {
      "id": "manifest",
      "kind": "manifest"
    },
    {
      "id": "pwm_duty",
      "kind": "json_value",
      "path": "demo-project.json",
      "pointer": "/modules/0/actual/duty_percent",
      "expected": 40
    },
    {
      "id": "pwm_frequency",
      "kind": "json_value",
      "path": "demo-project.json",
      "pointer": "/modules/0/actual/frequency_hz",
      "expected": 20000
    },
    {
      "id": "preserved_TC1_Work.c",
      "kind": "unchanged",
      "path": "TC1_Work.c"
    },
    {
      "id": "preserved_COMMON.H",
      "kind": "unchanged",
      "path": "COMMON.H"
    },
    {
      "id": "preserved_MASSESCHIP_DEFINE.H",
      "kind": "unchanged",
      "path": "MASSESCHIP_DEFINE.H"
    },
    {
      "id": "preserved_agent_demo_modules_demo_adc0.c",
      "kind": "unchanged",
      "path": "agent_demo/modules/demo_adc0.c"
    },
    {
      "id": "preserved_agent_demo_modules_demo_adc0.h",
      "kind": "unchanged",
      "path": "agent_demo/modules/demo_adc0.h"
    },
    {
      "id": "host_behavior",
      "kind": "command",
      "command": [
        "{python}",
        "{evaluation}/checks/multi_module.py",
        "--workspace",
        "{workspace}",
        "--seed",
        "{evaluation}/fixtures/pwm_usart_adc",
        "--out",
        "{out}/host"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
